<title>USA: Hill, W.House tax plan does not repeal de minimis.</title>
<headline>Hill, W.House tax plan does not repeal de minimis.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The White House and congressional leaders negotiated a tax bill that does not include the House's plan to scale back the two-percent de minimis rule, a senior congressional aide said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tax bill negotiators also agreed to broad Senate language that would repeal the $150 million volume cap on 501(c)(3) bonds for new capital expenditures.</p>
</text>
